 110:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   =============================================
 111:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 112:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 113:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   The compilation define  USE_HAL_TIM_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 114:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 115:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 116:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 117:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   Use Function HAL_TIM_RegisterCallback() to register a callback.
 118:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   HAL_TIM_RegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 119:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   the Callback ID and a pointer to the user callback function.
 120:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 121:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 122:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   Use function HAL_TIM_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 123:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   weak function.
 124:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   HAL_TIM_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 125:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   and the Callback ID.
 126:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 127:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 128:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   These functions allow to register/unregister following callbacks:
 129:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Base_MspInitCallback              : TIM Base Msp Init Callback.
 130:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Base_MspDeInitCallback            : TIM Base Msp DeInit Callback.
 131:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) IC_MspInitCallback                : TIM IC Msp Init Callback.
